 "tenebrous-glades-note-\u0001_t": "幽暗林地手記-",
 "tenebrous-glades\u0001_t": "幽暗林地",
 "midnight-trainer\u0001_t": "午夜訓練師",
 "Two more Celestial classes, two more races and two more starter dungeons for the Far East.\nAlso contains Sceptre weapons and tweaks to existing Celestial classes.\u0001init.lua description": "遠東新增了兩個星辰職業、兩個種族與兩個初始地下城。\n同時包含權杖武器，並微調現有的星辰職業。",
 "#CRIMSON#Your timetravel has no effect on pre-determined outcomes such as this.\u0001log": "#CRIMSON#你的時空旅行對此類既定結果無效。",
 "Do you want to name your item?\n\u0001_t": "你想為你的物品命名嗎？\n",
 "#GOLD##{bold}#Midnight: Enables altered Anorithil/Sun Paladin talents?#WHITE##{normal}#\u0001_t": "#GOLD##{bold}#午夜：啟用修改後的奪光者/太陽騎士技能？#WHITE##{normal}#",
 "Enable altered Anorithil/Sun Paladin talents? #RED#Best not to change this option in the middle of a game.#LAST#\u0001_t": "啟用修改後的奪光者/太陽騎士技能？ #RED#最好不要在遊戲途中修改此選項。#LAST#",
 "#GOLD##{bold}#Midnight: NPCs use Midnight talents?#WHITE##{normal}#\u0001_t": "#GOLD##{bold}#午夜：NPC 使用午夜技能？#WHITE##{normal}#",
 "#GOLD##{bold}#Midnight: Enable Sceptres?#WHITE##{normal}#\u0001_t": "#GOLD##{bold}#午夜：啟用權杖？#WHITE##{normal}#",
 "project an attack as arcane damage doing 100%% weapon damage\u0001tformat": "投射奧術傷害攻擊，造成 100%% 武器傷害",
 "channel mana (increasing mana regen by 500%% for ten turns)\u0001tformat": "引導法力（提高 500%% 法力回復，持續十回合）",
 "Its either a mirror, or the shield of a Sun Paladin that liked polishing too much.\u0001_t": "這要麼是一面鏡子，要麼是某位太愛擦亮盾牌的太陽騎士的盾牌。",
 "A carefully constructed device for measuring and predicting the movements of celestial bodies.\u0001_t": "精心製作的裝置，用於測量與預測天體的運行。",
 "Though the crystal on the end refracts light in unexpected ways, this Sceptre is still strong enough to give out a good beating.\u0001_t": "雖然末端的水晶會以意想不到的方式折射光線，但這柄權杖依然夠結實，足以狠狠揍人一頓。",
 "They appear to be made of a metal you have never seen before. Shadows cling to them.\u0001_t": "它們似乎是由你從未見過的金屬製成，陰影依附其上。",
 "The end of this sceptre emits an acrid smoke and burns painfully if you touch it.\u0001_t": "這柄權杖的末端冒著刺鼻的煙霧，觸碰會感到劇烈灼痛。",
 "This sceptre has been designed to look like the arm of a demon. Wait, it is the arm of a demon! Eww...\u0001_t": "這柄權杖被設計成惡魔手臂的模樣。等等，這就是惡魔的手臂！噁……",
 "Black sparks leap of this sceptre whenever it senses hatred nearby.\u0001_t": "每當感應到附近的仇恨，這柄權杖就會迸發出黑色火花。",
 "The light from this beacon fills you with hope and courage.\u0001_t": "這盞信標的光芒讓你充滿希望與勇氣。",
 "Expertly crafted to channel lightning through its core, but has no control of where it goes next.\u0001_t": "經過精湛工藝打造，能引導閃電穿過其核心，但無法控制其下一步的去向。",
 "Powerful enchantments have been laid on this sceptre to make it able to break the most formidible of defenses, both physical and magical.\u0001_t": "這柄權杖被施加了強大的附魔，使其能突破最頑強的物理與魔法防禦。",
 "Invoke the power of the night to conceal and harm.\u0001_t": "喚起黑夜之力以隱蔽與傷害。",
 "Infuse your projectiles with celestial power, and make they shine like shooting stars.\u0001_t": "將星界之力注入你的投射物，使它們像流星般閃耀。",
 "Be guided on your path by the moons and the stars.\u0001_t": "讓雙月與群星指引你的道路。",
 "Bind the tenebrous powers into sigils to trap your foes.\u0001_t": "將幽暗力量束縛於印記中以困住你的敵人。",
 "Magic drawn from the two moons of Eyal, Summertide and Wintertide.\u0001_t": "源自埃亞爾雙月——夏潮與冬潮的魔法。",
 "The true terrible power of the Stars and Darkness.\u0001_t": "星辰與黑暗真正的恐怖力量。",
 "You fire a shot into orbit around the target. Every turn for %d turns, this shot will hit the adjacent creatures, but not the one it orbits.\u0001tformat": "你發射一顆彈丸繞行目標。在 %d 回合內，此彈丸每回合都會擊中相鄰的生物，但不會擊中其繞行的目標。",
 "Cosmic energies warp space around you, increasing your Accuracy by %d and your movement speed by %d%%.\n\t\tProjectiles are also affected. Yours travel %d%% faster, whereas enemy projectiles targetting you will travel %d%% slower.\u0001tformat": "宇宙能量扭曲你周圍的空間，使你的命中增加 %d，移動速度提高 %d%%。\n\t\t投射物也會受到影響。你的投射物飛行速度加快 %d%%，而瞄準你的敵方投射物飛行速度減慢 %d%%。",
 "You step out of phase with reality.\n\t\tFor %d turns, you can walk through walls and gain +%d defense, +%d%% resist all and debuff duration reduction.\n\t\tThese effects will scale with Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "你脫離了現實相位。\n\t\t在 %d 回合內，你可以穿牆，並獲得 +%d 防禦、+%d%% 全屬性抵抗，且縮短減益狀態持續時間。\n\t\t這些效果將隨法術強度提升。",
 "Opens a small portal to the depths of the darkest of stars for %d turns.\n\t\tEach turn in a radius of %d, it will try to pull creatures towards its centre, also doing %0.2f darkness damage.\n\t\tThe damage done will scale with your Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "開啟一個通往最暗星辰深處的微型傳送門，持續 %d 回合。\n\t\t每回合在半徑 %d 內，它會嘗試將生物拉向中心，並造成 %0.2f 暗影傷害。\n\t\t造成的傷害將隨你的法術強度提升。",
 "Wrap yourself in protective celestial magic, increasing your defense by %d, your armour hardiness by %d%% and your light and dark resistance by %d%%.\n\t\tThese effects will scale with Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "使自己籠罩在保護性的星界魔法中，使你的防禦提升 %d，護甲值韌性提高 %d%%，且光明與暗影抵抗提高 %d%%。\n\t\t這些效果將隨法術強度提升。",
 "Invokes the stars to guide you into attacking up to %d enemies near your target, up to 6 grids apart.\n\t\tEach attack made will do %d%% weapon damage as darkness and will daze them for %d turns.\u0001tformat": "召喚星辰引導你攻擊目標附近最多 %d 個敵人，相距最多 6 格。\n\t\t每次攻擊造成 %d%% 暗影武器傷害，並使其眩暈 %d 回合。",
 "Imbue your blood with magic from the heavens, increasing your healing by %d%%.\n\t\tWhen you take damage you will also gain 1 point of negative energy per 10 damage taken.\n\t\tHealing factor scales with Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "將來自天界的魔法灌注於血液中，提升你的治療效果 %d%%。\n\t\t當你受到傷害時，每受到 10 點傷害還會獲得 1 點負能量。\n\t\t治療係數隨法術強度提升。",
 "Any attack that would drop you below 1 hit point instead triggers Celestial Intervention, deactivating the talent and granting you a damage shield for 5 turns that can block up to %d damage.\u0001tformat": "任何會使你的生命值降至 1 點以下的攻擊，都會改為觸發天界干涉，關閉該技能並獲得一個持續 5 回合、最多可吸收 %d 點傷害的傷害護盾。",
 "Attack the target with your weapon doing %d%% damage. If the strike connects, it will explode in a burst of light that inflicts %0.2f light damage on all targets except yourself within radius %d of the target.\n\t\tThe light damage will increase with your Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "用武器攻擊目標，造成 %d%% 傷害。若擊中目標，將引發光芒爆炸，造成 %0.2f 點光系傷害，範圍為目標半徑 %d 內除你以外的所有目標。\n\t\t光系傷害隨法術強度提升。",
 "Attack the target with your weapon doing %d%% damage. If the strike connects, it will explode in a burst of darkness that inflicts %0.2f darkness damage on all targets except yourself within radius %d of the target.\n\t\tThe dark damage will increase with your Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "用武器攻擊目標，造成 %d%% 傷害。若擊中目標，將引發暗影爆炸，造成 %0.2f 點暗影傷害，範圍為目標半徑 %d 內除你以外的所有目標。\n\t\t暗影傷害隨法術強度提升。",
 "Open a moongate to the target tile. Light will pour from the gate for %0.2f light damage in a radius of 2.\n\t\tYou then step through the gate and appear at the target tile. Darkness will pour from the gate behind you for %0.2f darkness damage in a radius of 2.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "在目標格開啟一道月之門。光芒將從傳送門湧出，在半徑 2 內造成 %0.2f 點光系傷害。\n\t\t接著你穿過傳送門，出現在目標格。暗影將從你身後的傳送門湧出，在半徑 2 內造成 %0.2f 點暗影傷害。\n\t\t傷害隨法術強度提升。",
 "You cannot use Twin Moons without an offhand weapon/shield!\u0001logPlayer": "沒有副手武器/盾牌，你無法使用雙月！",
 "You cannot use Twin Moons without an onhand weapon!\u0001logPlayer": "沒有主手武器，你無法使用雙月！",
 "Two Moons, Two Weapons, Two Strikes, Two Targets. Channel the power of the Moons into a devastating attack.\n\t\tFirst strike with your main weapon doing light damage, then your offhand for fire damage.\n\t\tThen strike again with your main hand weapon for darkness damage, then your offhand for cold damage.\n\t\tYou may select a different target for the second attack. You may use a shield as the offhand weapon.\n\t\tEach hit does %d%% weapon damage.\u0001tformat": "雙月、雙武器、雙重打擊、雙重目標。將雙月之力注入毀滅性的攻擊中。\n\t\t首次攻擊用主手武器造成光系傷害，接著用副手武器造成火焰傷害。\n\t\t隨後再次用主手武器造成暗影傷害，接著用副手武器造成冰冷傷害。\n\t\t你可以為第二次攻擊選擇不同的目標。你可以使用盾牌作為副手武器。\n\t\t每次命中造成 %d%% 武器傷害。",
 "Invoke the power of the Moons to release a pulse of alien magic that disrupts the auras of your targets within radius 3, stunning them for %d turns, and dispelling a beneficial magical effect/talent from them.\u0001tformat": "喚醒雙月之力，釋放一道異界魔法脈衝，擾亂半徑 3 內目標的氣場，使其震懾 %d 回合，並驅散其身上的一個有益魔法效果/技能。",
 "You invoke moon waters in a frontal cone of radius %d. \n\t\tAny target caught in the area will take %0.2f darkness damage, %0.2f physical damage, %0.2f cold damage and be knocked back two tiles.\n\t\tThe damage will scale with Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "你在前方半徑 %d 的錐形區域召喚月之水。 \n\t\t任何處於該區域內的目標將受到 %0.2f 點暗影傷害、%0.2f 點物理傷害、%0.2f 點冰冷傷害，並被擊退兩格。\n\t\t傷害隨法術強度提升。",
 "A refreshing ray of Night shines on you, restoring %d stamina and reducing the duration of detrimental effects by %d.\n\t\tThe amount of stamina restored will increase with your Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "一道令人振奮的黑夜之光照耀著你，恢復 %d 點體力並縮短有害效果持續時間 %d。\n\t\t恢復的體力量隨法術強度提升。",
 "A magical zone of Night covers you, increasing your stealth and invisibility by %d and harming those who hit you in melee for %0.2f darkness damage. The effect lasts for %d turns.\n\t\tEffect power scales with Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "一個魔法般的黑夜領域覆蓋著你，提升你的潛行與隱形值 %d，並對近戰攻擊你的敵人造成 %0.2f 點暗影傷害。效果持續 %d 回合。\n\t\t效果強度隨法術強度提升。",
 "Breaks all damage shields (or similar) in a radius of %d around you and increases your movement speed by %d%% for one turn.\n\t\tThe movement speed increases with your Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "破除你周圍半徑 %d 內的所有傷害護盾（或類似效果），並提升你的移動速度 %d%%，持續一回合。\n\t\t移動速度隨法術強度提升。",
 "You walk in the dark, and when night falls on an enemies life, you harvest %0.1f negative energy from their death.\n\t\tAlso, your weapon attacks will release a radius 1 burst of darkness when you critically hit, for %0.2f damage.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.\u0001tformat": "你在暗影中行走，當黑夜降臨在敵人的生命上時，你會從他們的死亡中收割 %0.1f 點負能量。\n\t\t此外，當你造成暴擊時，你的武器攻擊會釋放半徑 1 的暗影爆炸，造成 %0.2f 點傷害。\n\t\t傷害隨法術強度提升。",
 "Welcome #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#.\nYou are a citizen of the Sunwall, and like many of your age you have been trained in combat and magic. It can be a harsh life, and though you dream at times of venturing to distant lands you know your duty is to help defend the outpost against the vicious onslaught from the Orc Prides. Most of the soldiers are out in skirmishes with the hated Orcs, as a green recruit you must stay in the relative safety of the Sunwall.\n\nThough you itch to fight Orcs, you have been assigned two mundane tasks instead. Vermin are eating the crops in the Sunwall Orchards. Exterminate them or we will all go hungry.\nThe shadows that were summoned to hide the Midnight Training Camp are restless and becoming aggressive. Quell them and seek out the cause.\n\nBy the power of the Sun and the blessings of the Moons you step forth to find your fate.\n\u0001tformat": "歡迎 #LIGHT_GREEN#@name@#WHITE#。\n你是太陽之牆的公民，與許多同齡人一樣接受過戰鬥與魔法的訓練。這是一段艱苦的生活，雖然你偶爾夢想著前往遙遠的國度冒險，但你深知自己的職責是協助防守哨所，抵禦獸人部落的殘暴襲擊。大多數士兵都在外與令人憎恨的獸人交戰，作為一名新兵，你必須留在相對安全的太陽之牆。\n\n雖然你渴望與獸人交戰，但你卻被分配了兩個平凡的任務。害蟲正在蠶食太陽之牆果園的作物。消滅牠們，否則我們都會挨餓。\n被召喚來隱藏午夜訓練營的陰影正躁動不安並變得具有攻擊性。鎮壓牠們並尋找原因。\n\n憑藉太陽的力量與雙月的祝福，你踏上前路去尋找你的命運。\n",
 "Most of the soldiers are out in skirmishes with the hated Orcs, as a green recruit you must stay in the relative safety of the Sunwall.\n\u0001_t": "大多數士兵都在外與令人憎恨的獸人交戰，作為一名新兵，你必須留在相對安全的太陽之牆。\n",
 "Though you itch to fight Orcs, you have been assigned two mundane tasks instead.\n\u0001_t": "雖然你渴望與獸人交戰，但你卻被分配了兩個平凡的任務。\n",
 "#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have killed the strange horror causing most of the crop destruction.#WHITE#\u0001_t": "#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你已經殺死了造成大部分作物被毀的奇特恐懼生物。#WHITE#",
 "#SLATE#* Vermin are eating the crops in the Sunwall Orchards.#WHITE#\u0001_t": "#SLATE#* 害蟲正在蠶食太陽之牆果園的作物。#WHITE#",
 "#SLATE#* Exterminate them or we will all go hungry.#WHITE#\u0001_t": "#SLATE#* 消滅牠們，否則我們都會挨餓。#WHITE#",
 "#LIGHT_GREEN#* The Mad Astrologer is dead, but you can't help feel a sense of impending doom...#WHITE#\u0001_t": "#LIGHT_GREEN#* 瘋狂占星術士已死，但你仍不禁感到一股即將來臨的厄運感……#WHITE#",
 "#SLATE#* The shadows that were summoned to hide the Midnight Training Camp are restless and becoming aggressive.#WHITE#\u0001_t": "#SLATE#* 被召喚來隱藏午夜訓練營的陰影正躁動不安並變得具有攻擊性。#WHITE#",
 "#SLATE#* Quell them and seek out the cause.#WHITE#\u0001_t": "#SLATE#* 鎮壓牠們並尋找原因。#WHITE#",
 "Welcome @playername@, do you need some instruction?\u0001_t": "歡迎 @playername@，你需要一些指引嗎？",
